# 🧠 KEP.uz — Python Problem Solutions

This repository contains my solutions to algorithmic problems from [KEP.uz](https://kep.uz/) written in **Python**.

My main goal is to improve my problem-solving skills, strengthen my Python knowledge, and build a strong foundation in algorithms and data structures.

## 🎯 Goal

**Solve 1000–1500+ algorithmic problems.**

This repository tracks my progress as I continue learning programming and algorithms.

## 🐍 Programming Language

* Python 3

## 📂 Repository Structure

Problems are organized into folders by their numbers:

```text
Kep/
├── 1-50/
├── 51-100/
├── 101-150/
├── 151-200/
├── 201-250/
├── easy_random/
└── README.md
```

Each `.py` file contains the solution to a corresponding problem from KEP.uz.

Example:

```text
1-50/
├── 1.py
├── 2.py
├── 3.py
...
└── 50.py
```

